OL,3,GNEWSAMandatory workplace pensions
OL,4,Apriority for minister
OL,5,
OL,6,FJersey Chamber of Commerce said many
OL,7,Fbusinesses already provided workplace
OL,8,Fpensions, but for those which did not
OL,9,Fit could have a significant impact; and
OL,10,FUnite the Union supported the
OL,11,Fintroduction of the schemes in Jersey.
OL,13,FSenator Elaine Millar said work on the
OL,14,Fscheme never "really went away" but
OL,15,Fother work was prioritised instead.
